  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add garlic, ginger and onion, sauté until fragrant, about 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in sliced chilies and shrimp paste, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add shrimp, cook until pink and cooked through, about 3 minutes.",
    "Pour in coconut milk, fish sauce, soy sauce, brown sugar and salt, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes to blend flavors.",
    "Stir in lime juice, then remove from heat.",
    "Garnish with chopped coriander and serve hot over steamed rice.",
    "Enjoy the zesty, silky delight!"
  ],
